{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And as the dawn rose.</b> This verse was written because it is about to say 'the sun rose upon the earth and Lot came to Zoar,' to let it be known that the angels waited all that long to destroy the cities for the sake of the beloved merit of Abraham our father. Rabbi Chanina said: from when the pillar of dawn rises until the sun emerges is five milin, as it is written 'and as the dawn rose,' and as it is written 'the sun rose upon the earth and Lot came to Zoar,' and from Sodom to Zoar is five milin."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:52.775053024Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}